{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412090","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041209001:0":{"text":"안녕, 다미안. 내가 숲을 떠난 3년 동안 좋은 거 많이 만들었겠지?","source_cn":"嘿，达米安，我离开丛林都三年了，你肯定做出来不少好东西吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E0EFF97E5F067C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041209002:0":{"text":"물론이죠! 폭포 덩굴다리, 추적 통발, 추락 연 등등... 아주 많아요!","source_cn":"当然！像什么攀瀑藤梯、追踪捕鱼笼、坠地风筝……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA951BE691E360B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041209003:0":{"text":"이 중 최고는 자동 붕대 감기 나무인형이에요! 이걸 만든 후부턴 딘 아저씨한테 상처 치료를 부탁할 일이 없어서 덜 혼나고 있어요!","source_cn":"还有最重磅的——自动包扎木头人！自从有了它，我就再也没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71AA02C28501AF0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041209004:1":{"text":"흥, 골치 아픈 두 녀석이 모였구나!","source_cn":"哼，你们两个麻烦的小子，这时候凑到一起了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3AEE1F659F0C4A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041209005:1":{"text":"너희가 3년 동안 친 사고가 얼마나 많은진 왜 얘기 안 하니!","source_cn":"怎么这时候不提你们这三年闯了多少祸呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA484424A28CB3108","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docu